## Hypotheses are satisfiable, and the spec rejects bad outputs

The cases above are the concrete inputs. The assertions below reject known-bad
results: the credit without the 15% step ($3,750), the unrounded 15% ($562.50),
the credit at the strict AGI limit, a credit for MFS spouses who lived together,
the AGI test of the wrong (joint) limit for a one-qualified couple, and the credit
above the tax.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestRejectsBad:
  output ok condition
  a scope Run
  b scope Run
  c scope Run
  d scope Run
  e scope Run

scope TestRejectsBad:
  rule ok fulfilled
  definition a.filing_status equals Single
  definition a.apart equals false
  definition a.p65 equals true
  definition a.s65 equals false
  definition a.pd equals false
  definition a.pinc equals $0
  definition a.sd equals false
  definition a.sinc equals $0
  definition a.agi equals $10,000
  definition a.ss equals $0
  definition a.o13b equals $0
  definition a.tax equals $10,000
  definition b.filing_status equals Single
  definition b.apart equals false
  definition b.p65 equals true
  definition b.s65 equals false
  definition b.pd equals false
  definition b.pinc equals $0
  definition b.sd equals false
  definition b.sinc equals $0
  definition b.agi equals $17,500
  definition b.ss equals $0
  definition b.o13b equals $0
  definition b.tax equals $10,000
  definition c.filing_status equals MarriedFilingSeparately
  definition c.apart equals false
  definition c.p65 equals true
  definition c.s65 equals false
  definition c.pd equals false
  definition c.pinc equals $0
  definition c.sd equals false
  definition c.sinc equals $0
  definition c.agi equals $8,000
  definition c.ss equals $0
  definition c.o13b equals $0
  definition c.tax equals $10,000
  definition d.filing_status equals MarriedFilingJointly
  definition d.apart equals false
  definition d.p65 equals true
  definition d.s65 equals false
  definition d.pd equals false
  definition d.pinc equals $0
  definition d.sd equals false
  definition d.sinc equals $0
  definition d.agi equals $22,000
  definition d.ss equals $0
  definition d.o13b equals $0
  definition d.tax equals $10,000
  definition e.filing_status equals Single
  definition e.apart equals false
  definition e.p65 equals true
  definition e.s65 equals false
  definition e.pd equals false
  definition e.pinc equals $0
  definition e.sd equals false
  definition e.sinc equals $0
  definition e.agi equals $10,000
  definition e.ss equals $0
  definition e.o13b equals $0
  definition e.tax equals $100

  assertion a.total_edc = $563
  assertion not (a.total_edc = $3,750)
  assertion not (a.total_edc = $562.50)
  assertion not (a.total_edc = $562)
  assertion b.total_edc = $0
  assertion not (b.qualified)
  assertion c.total_edc = $0
  assertion not (c.total_edc = $338)
  # one spouse 65 or older, AGI 22,000: over the $20,000 limit for one
  # qualified spouse (the joint limit $25,000 would wrongly allow it)
  assertion d.agi_limit = $20,000
  assertion d.total_edc = $0
  # credit above the tax is rejected
  assertion e.total_edc = $100
  assertion not (e.total_edc = $563)
```

## Disability answers

Direct answers for a single filer under 65 whose only income is the taxable
disability pension in W-2 wages: AGI = income = $4,000, so line 16 is 0 and the
credit is 15% x min(5,000, 4,000) = $600.

```catala
declaration scope RunSingleDisabled:
  input ret content boolean
  input has content boolean
  input met content boolean
  input pay content boolean
  input inc content money
  input w2 content boolean
  sr scope E.ScheduleR
  output edc_line2 condition
  output edc_net_credit_amount content money
  output total_edc content money
  output qualified condition

scope RunSingleDisabled:
  definition sr.filing_status equals Single
  definition sr.lived_apart_all_year equals false
  definition sr.primary_age65_or_older equals false
  definition sr.secondary_age65_or_older equals false
  definition sr.primary_answers equals E.DisabilityAnswers {
    -- is_retired_on_perm_or_total_disability: ret
    -- employer_has_mandatory_retirement_age: has
    -- has_met_employer_mandatory_retirement_age: met
    -- are_payments_taxable_disability_income: pay
    -- writable_total_taxable_disability_amount: inc
    -- has_w2_wages: w2
  }
  definition sr.secondary_answers equals E.DisabilityAnswers {
    -- is_retired_on_perm_or_total_disability: false
    -- employer_has_mandatory_retirement_age: false
    -- has_met_employer_mandatory_retirement_age: false
    -- are_payments_taxable_disability_income: false
    -- writable_total_taxable_disability_amount: $0
    -- has_w2_wages: false
  }
  definition sr.agi equals $4,000
  definition sr.non_taxable_social_security_benefits equals $0
  definition sr.self_reported_non_taxable_payments equals $0
  definition sr.credit_limit_worksheet_line_3 equals $10,000
  definition edc_line2 equals sr.edc_line2
  definition edc_net_credit_amount equals sr.edc_net_credit_amount
  definition total_edc equals sr.total_edc
  definition qualified equals sr.qualified_for_credit_for_elderly_and_disabled
```

Cases: `mandatory_retirement_met` (single under 65, retired on disability, employer has a mandatory retirement age and the filer has reached it: no credit); `mandatory_retirement_not_met` (same, but the filer has not reached it: credit); `no_disability_payments` (retired on disability but the payments are not taxable disability income); `zero_disability_income` (retired on disability, taxable payments of $0); `not_retired` (not retired on disability); `no_w2_wages` (disability income asked only of a filer with W-2 wages (DF scope limit)).

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestDisabilityAnswers:
  output ok condition
  mandatory_retirement_met scope RunSingleDisabled
  mandatory_retirement_not_met scope RunSingleDisabled
  no_disability_payments scope RunSingleDisabled
  zero_disability_income scope RunSingleDisabled
  not_retired scope RunSingleDisabled
  no_w2_wages scope RunSingleDisabled

scope TestDisabilityAnswers:
  rule ok fulfilled
  definition mandatory_retirement_met.ret equals true
  definition mandatory_retirement_met.has equals true
  definition mandatory_retirement_met.met equals true
  definition mandatory_retirement_met.pay equals true
  definition mandatory_retirement_met.inc equals $4,000
  definition mandatory_retirement_met.w2 equals true
  definition mandatory_retirement_not_met.ret equals true
  definition mandatory_retirement_not_met.has equals true
  definition mandatory_retirement_not_met.met equals false
  definition mandatory_retirement_not_met.pay equals true
  definition mandatory_retirement_not_met.inc equals $4,000
  definition mandatory_retirement_not_met.w2 equals true
  definition no_disability_payments.ret equals true
  definition no_disability_payments.has equals false
  definition no_disability_payments.met equals false
  definition no_disability_payments.pay equals false
  definition no_disability_payments.inc equals $4,000
  definition no_disability_payments.w2 equals true
  definition zero_disability_income.ret equals true
  definition zero_disability_income.has equals false
  definition zero_disability_income.met equals false
  definition zero_disability_income.pay equals true
  definition zero_disability_income.inc equals $0
  definition zero_disability_income.w2 equals true
  definition not_retired.ret equals false
  definition not_retired.has equals false
  definition not_retired.met equals false
  definition not_retired.pay equals true
  definition not_retired.inc equals $4,000
  definition not_retired.w2 equals true
  definition no_w2_wages.ret equals true
  definition no_w2_wages.has equals false
  definition no_w2_wages.met equals false
  definition no_w2_wages.pay equals true
  definition no_w2_wages.inc equals $4,000
  definition no_w2_wages.w2 equals false
  assertion mandatory_retirement_met.edc_line2 = false
  assertion mandatory_retirement_met.qualified = false
  assertion mandatory_retirement_met.total_edc = $0
  assertion mandatory_retirement_not_met.edc_line2 = true
  assertion mandatory_retirement_not_met.qualified = true
  assertion mandatory_retirement_not_met.edc_net_credit_amount = $4,000
  assertion mandatory_retirement_not_met.total_edc = $600
  assertion no_disability_payments.edc_line2 = false
  assertion no_disability_payments.qualified = false
  assertion no_disability_payments.total_edc = $0
  assertion zero_disability_income.edc_line2 = false
  assertion zero_disability_income.qualified = false
  assertion zero_disability_income.total_edc = $0
  assertion not_retired.edc_line2 = false
  assertion not_retired.qualified = false
  assertion not_retired.total_edc = $0
  assertion no_w2_wages.edc_line2 = false
  assertion no_w2_wages.qualified = false
  assertion no_w2_wages.total_edc = $0
```
